    </section>

    <section class="portal-positioning-roles__role portal-positioning-roles__role--portal">
      <header><span class="eyebrow">Portal</span><strong>Where should it render?</strong></header>
      <ul>
        <li><code>Place</code><span>the overlay in <code>#modal-root</code></span></li>
        <li><code>Escape</code><span>clipping and a parent context</span></li>
        <li><code>Preserve</code><span>React ownership and events</span></li>
      </ul>
      <small>Example: <code>createPortal()</code></small>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="portal-positioning-roles__result"><span>Result</span><strong>A correctly placed overlay that is free to render above the UI.</strong></div>
  <figcaption id="portal-positioning-roles-caption">Positioning calculates coordinates. A portal controls DOM placement. Production floating UI often needs both.</figcaption>
</figure>

